WEBVTT

00:07:57.676 --> 00:08:00.756
because you just don't know

00:08:00.796 --> 00:08:04.756
to what lengths they will
finally go to crush it.

00:08:04.796 --> 00:08:07.116
And so I'm waiting,
as a journalist should,

00:08:07.156 --> 00:08:09.836
I'm watching, I'm waiting,
I'm interviewing,

00:08:09.876 --> 00:08:13.236
I'm getting as much information
as I possibly can.

00:08:13.636 --> 00:08:15.796
And I'm going to be doing it
on my show today,

00:08:15.836 --> 00:08:18.076
which will air, as you said,
on CNNi and on PBS.

00:08:18.116 --> 00:08:21.596
And I've done it many times
with many Iranian interlocutors.

00:08:21.636 --> 00:08:22.796
And ...

00:08:24.636 --> 00:08:29.796
This is a very brutal regime
when it comes to staying in power.

00:08:29.836 --> 00:08:33.476
But the only thing
that I think is interesting,